<h4 class="style1"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Arial","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"Times New Roman"'>February 9, 2010<o:p></o:p></span></h4>

<p class="style1">&nbsp;</p>
                <p class="style1">
                    <span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Arial","sans-serif";color:black'>The
    <b>ChatBug Privacy Policy</b> describes how we treat personal information when you use <span
class=SpellE>ChatBug's</span> products and services, including information
provided when you use <span class=SpellE>ChatBug</span>. In addition, the
following describes our privacy practices that are specific to <span
class=SpellE>ChatBug</span>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<h4 class="style1">&nbsp;</h4>
                <h4 class="style1">
                    <span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Arial","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"Times New Roman"'>Personal information<o:p></o:p></span></h4>

<p class=style2 style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;
tab-stops:list .5in'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;
color:black'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Arial","sans-serif";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:black'>You need a <b>ChatBug account</b> to access <span class=SpellE>ChatBug</span>.
<span class=SpellE>ChatBug</span> asks for some personal information when you
create a <span class=SpellE>ChatBug</span> Account, including your alternate
contact information and a password, which is used to protect your account from
unauthorized access. A <span class=SpellE>ChatBug</span> Account allows you to
access many of our services that require registration.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=style2 style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;
tab-stops:list .5in'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;
color:black'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span class=SpellE><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:"Arial","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
color:black'>ChatBug</span></span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Arial","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:black'>
stores, processes and maintains your messages, contact lists and other data
related to your account in order to provide the service to you.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=style2 style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;
tab-stops:list .5in'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;
color:black'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Arial","sans-serif";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:black'>When you use <span
class=SpellE>ChatBug</span>, <span class=SpellE>ChatBug's</span> servers
automatically record certain information about your use of <span class=SpellE>ChatBug</span>.
Similar to other web services, <span class=SpellE>ChatBug</span> records
information such as account activity (including storage usage, number of
log-ins), data displayed or clicked on (including UI elements, ads, links); and
other log information (including browser type, IP-address, date and time of access,
cookie ID, and referrer URL).<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<h4 class="style1">&nbsp;</h4>
                <h4 class="style1">
                    <span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Arial","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"Times New Roman"'>Uses<o:p></o:p></span></h4>

<p class=style2 style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;
tab-stops:list .5in'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;
color:black'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span class=SpellE>
    <span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:"Arial","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
color:black'>ChatBug</span></span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Arial","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:black'>
maintains and processes your <span class=SpellE>ChatBug</span> account and its
contents to provide the <span class=SpellE>ChatBug</span> service to you and to
improve our services. The <span class=SpellE>ChatBug</span> service includes
relevant advertising and related links based on the IP address, content of
messages and other information related to your use of <span class=SpellE>ChatBug</span>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=style2 style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;
tab-stops:list .5in'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;
color:black'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span class=SpellE><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:"Arial","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
color:black'>ChatBug's</span></span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Arial","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:black'>
computers process the information in your messages for various purposes,
including formatting and displaying the information to you, delivering
advertisements and related links, preventing unsolicited bulk email (spam),
backing up your messages, and other purposes relating to offering you <span
class=SpellE>ChatBug</span>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=style2 style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;
tab-stops:list .5in'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;
color:black'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span class=SpellE><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:"Arial","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
color:black'>ChatBug</span></span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Arial","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:black'>
may send you information related to your <span class=SpellE>ChatBug</span>
account or other <span class=SpellE>ChatBug</span> services.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<h4 class="style1">&nbsp;</h4>
                <h4 class="style1">
                    <span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Arial","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"Times New Roman"'>Information sharing and onward transfer<o:p></o:p></span></h4>

<p class=style2 style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo4;
tab-stops:list .5in'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;
color:black'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Arial","sans-serif";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:black'>When you send email, <span
class=SpellE>ChatBug</span> includes information such as your email address and
the email itself as part of that email.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=style2 style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo4;
tab-stops:list .5in'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;
color:black'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Arial","sans-serif";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:black'>We provide advertisers
only aggregated non-personal information such as the number of times one of
their ads was clicked. We do not sell, rent or otherwise share your personal
information with any third parties except in the limited circumstances
described in the <b>ChatBug Privacy Policy</b>, such as when we believe we are
required to do so by law.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<h4 class="style1">&nbsp;</h4>
                <h4 class="style1">
                    <span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Arial","sans-serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"Times New Roman"'>Your choices<o:p></o:p></span></h4>

<p class=style2 style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo5;
