</span></span></span><![endif]><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Arial","sans-serif";
mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:black'>You may change your <span
class=SpellE>ChatBug</span> account information through the <span class=SpellE>ChatBug</span>
&quot;edit accounts info&quot; section. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=style2 style='mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo5;
